589
00:37:51.632 --> 00:37:52.733
Is al goed.

590
00:37:53.467 --> 00:37:55.217
- Laat hem er uit.
- Sorry.

591
00:37:55.218 --> 00:37:56.528
Omhoog drukken.

592
00:37:59.139 --> 00:38:00.448
Zachary.

593
00:38:01.891 --> 00:38:03.392
Neem dit mee.

594
00:38:03.393 --> 00:38:05.645
Doe net of je om handtekeningen
